 },
 "duration": 57.767,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "h01",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Here's a question that sounds easy.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.427,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h02",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "You're twenty-eight.",
   "refs": [
    "you.start_age"
   ],
   "start": 2.847,
   "end": 3.955,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h03",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "You've got three thousand dollars.",
   "refs": [
    "you.lump"
   ],
   "start": 4.375,
   "end": 6.226,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h04",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "You can take the trip you've talked about for years\u2026 or invest it.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 6.646,
   "end": 10.205,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h05",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "At seven percent a year, that three thousand becomes about fifty-one thousand dollars by the time you're seventy.",
   "refs": [
    "you.rate_pct",
    "you.lump",
    "you.about_51k",
    "you.end_age"
   ],
   "start": 10.625,
   "end": 17.366,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h06",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "So the smart move is obvious, right?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 17.786,
   "end": 19.901,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h07",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Well\u2026 not quite.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 20.321,
   "end": 21.522,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h08",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Because there's something that money can't buy back.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 21.942,
   "end": 24.5,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m01",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "There's an idea from a book called Die With Zero by Bill Perkins.",
   "refs": [
    "=0"
   ],
   "start": 25.3,
   "end": 29.063,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m02",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "He calls it the memory dividend.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 29.483,
   "end": 31.455,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m03",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "When you pay for an experience, you don't just get the experience.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 31.875,
   "end": 35.316,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m04",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "You get the memory, and that memory keeps paying out.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 35.736,
   "end": 38.566,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m05",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "Every time you tell the story.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 38.986,
   "end": 40.789,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m06",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "Every time a song takes you back to that beach.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 41.209,
   "end": 43.857,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m07",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "Every time a friend says \"remember when\u2026\"",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 44.277,
   "end": 46.582,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m08",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "The trip lasts two weeks.",
   "refs": [
    "you.trip_weeks"
   ],
   "start": 47.002,
   "end": 48.591,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m09",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "The dividend lasts forty years.",
   "refs": [
    "you.dividend_years"
   ],
   "start": 49.011,
   "end": 50.954,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m10",
   "section": "memory",
   "text": "And just like interest, the earlier you invest in a memory, the longer it pays you back.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 51.374,
   "end": 56.167,
   "chunk": 1
  }
 ],
